# WRONG: expand/cancel printer emits a rounded decimal for an exact rational
# constant while claiming "check: exact (both sides have the same normal form)".
# SymPy oracle: (-4x^3-2x^2-2x+2)/(6x-3) = -2/3*x^2 - 2/3*x - 2/3 exactly.
cancel (-4x^3 - 2x^2 - 2x + 2)/(6x - 3)
expand 1/3*x + 2/3
factor (-4x^3 - 2x^2 - 2x + 2)/(6x - 3)
